# LCOS lcos-base: AMD PCI device IDs (vendor 0x1002) that the amdgpu kernel
# driver handles as pre-Vega (CHIP_TAHITI..CHIP_VEGAM: SI, CIK, VI, Polaris,
# VegaM). On these, LCOS installs NO modesetting snippet (0.8 behaviour).
# Any other device bound to amdgpu is treated as Vega/GFX9 or newer.
# Generated by packaging/tools/gen-amdgpu-pre-vega-ids.py from Linux 7.2.6 amdgpu_drv.c pciidlist.
# 204 IDs. Format: <device-id lowercase hex> <CHIP_ family>
